the Workflow Editor, click the Open button. Find and select the K14 Rollback Example One workflow","target":"sys_attachment.do?sys_id=5ffc1b8193d5ba10057c7de86cba1005","line":45,"embedded":true},{"title":"Select the Gear Menu > Properties","target":"sys_attachment.do?sys_id=dbfc1b8193d5ba10057c7de86cba100a","line":49,"embedded":true},{"title":"Expand the Approvals Category the Activities Tree.","target":"sys_attachment.do?sys_id=effc1b8193d5ba10057c7de86cba10c1","line":57,"embedded":true},{"title":"  Click the Rollback To Activity in the Approvals folder.","target":"sys_attachment.do?sys_id=6bfc1b8193d5ba10057c7de86cba10c5","line":65,"embedded":true},{"title":"Select the Gear Menu > Expand Transitions.","target":"sys_attachment.do?sys_id=63fc1b8193d5ba10057c7de86cba10e2","line":73,"embedded":true},{"title":"Arrange the activities so all the transition lines are clear.","target":"sys_attachment.do?sys_id=abfc1b8193d5ba10057c7de86cba10e5","line":81,"embedded":true},{"title":"About the rollback to approval records","target":"sys_attachment.do?sys_id=e3fc1b8193d5ba10057c7de86cba10e9","line":87,"embedded":true},{"title":"With tabs active, scroll down the form and find the Approvals Related List","target":"sys_attachment.do?sys_id=2bfc1b8193d5ba10057c7de86cba10f9","line":101,"embedded":true},{"title":" Right-Click > Approve.","target":"sys_attachment.do?sys_id=e3fc1b8193d5ba10057c7de86cba10fd","line":105,"embedded":true},{"title":"A second Approval, K14-Approver Two, appears in the list","target":"sys_attachment.do?sys_id=13fc1b8193d5ba10057c7de86cba1066","line":113,"embedded":true},{"title":"Right-Click > Reject.","target":"sys_attachment.do?sys_id=17fc1b8193d5ba10057c7de86cba106a","line":123,"embedded":true},{"title":"Completed correct list","target":"sys_attachment.do?sys_id=1bfc1b8193d5ba10057c7de86cba106e","line":137,"embedded":true},{"title":"Completed correct workflow","target":"sys_attachment.do?sys_id=1ffc1b8193d5ba10057c7de86cba1072","line":143,"embedded":true},{"title":"Hover your mouse over the Approval Two Activity.","target":"sys_attachment.do?sys_id=13fc1b8193d5ba10057c7de86cba1077","line":147,"embedded":true},{"title":"In the Activities History list, right-click on a Restarted Activity.","target":"sys_attachment.do?sys_id=17fc1b8193d5ba10057c7de86cba107b","line":167,"embedded":true},{"title":"Select Workflow Debug > Highlight Rollback.","target":"sys_attachment.do?sys_id=6ffc5b8193d5ba10057c7de86cba1000","line":171,"embedded":true},{"title":"Hover over the Log Message Reject Approval Two.","target":"sys_attachment.do?sys_id=97fc1b8193d5ba10057c7de86cba1098","line":189,"embedded":true},{"title":"Notice that its state is Finished. The Workflow Context Diagram reflects the most recent state of an Activity, even if it has multiple states in the Activity History.","target":"sys_attachment.do?sys_id=abfc1b8193d5ba10057c7de86cba109c","line":199,"embedded":true},{"title":"Select Show Timeline","target":"sys_attachment.do?sys_id=2ffc1b8193d5ba10057c7de86cba10b9","line":212,"embedded":true}],"metadata":{"title":"Workflow: Roll back approvals ","aliases":["KB0538562"],"tags":["#servicenow","#support-kb"],"source_url":"https://support.servicenow.com/kb?id=kb_article_view&sysparm_article=KB0538562","kb_number":"KB0538562","last_modified":"2025-11-17"},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[],"key":"ServiceNowOfficialDocs/support-and-troubleshooting/workflow/KB0538562 - Workflow Roll back approvals.md"},
