.do?sys_id=e3fc1b8193d5ba10057c7de86cba10e9","line":75,"embedded":true},{"title":"With tabs active, scroll down the form and find the Approvals Related List","target":"sys_attachment.do?sys_id=2bfc1b8193d5ba10057c7de86cba10f9","line":89,"embedded":true},{"title":" Right-Click > Approve.","target":"sys_attachment.do?sys_id=e3fc1b8193d5ba10057c7de86cba10fd","line":93,"embedded":true},{"title":"A second Approval, K14-Approver Two, appears in the list","target":"sys_attachment.do?sys_id=13fc1b8193d5ba10057c7de86cba1066","line":101,"embedded":true},{"title":"Right-Click > Reject.","target":"sys_attachment.do?sys_id=17fc1b8193d5ba10057c7de86cba106a","line":111,"embedded":true},{"title":"Completed correct list","target":"sys_attachment.do?sys_id=1bfc1b8193d5ba10057c7de86cba106e","line":125,"embedded":true},{"title":"Completed correct workflow","target":"sys_attachment.do?sys_id=1ffc1b8193d5ba10057c7de86cba1072","line":131,"embedded":true},{"title":"Hover your mouse over the Approval Two Activity.","target":"sys_attachment.do?sys_id=13fc1b8193d5ba10057c7de86cba1077","line":135,"embedded":true},{"title":"In the Activities History list, right-click on a Restarted Activity.","target":"sys_attachment.do?sys_id=17fc1b8193d5ba10057c7de86cba107b","line":155,"embedded":true},{"title":"Select Workflow Debug > Highlight Rollback.","target":"sys_attachment.do?sys_id=6ffc5b8193d5ba10057c7de86cba1000","line":159,"embedded":true},{"title":"Hover over the Log Message Reject Approval Two.","target":"sys_attachment.do?sys_id=97fc1b8193d5ba10057c7de86cba1098","line":177,"embedded":true},{"title":"Notice that its state is Finished. The Workflow Context Diagram reflects the most recent state of an Activity, even if it has multiple states in the Activity History.","target":"sys_attachment.do?sys_id=abfc1b8193d5ba10057c7de86cba109c","line":187,"embedded":true},{"title":"Select Show Timeline","target":"sys_attachment.do?sys_id=2ffc1b8193d5ba10057c7de86cba10b9","line":200,"embedded":true}],"class_name":"SmartBlock"},
